  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n> The element's group of [option](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-option-element) elements consists of the [option](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-option-element) elements that are children of the [optgroup](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-optgroup-element) element.\n\nThis is supposed to be no longer true and it's something much more complex now. It's nearest descendants, but there can't be interleaving optgroup, select, or hr elements?",
